# WATER-FALLS-FLOAT: Water_Falls - a river (WaterBody River, FlowSpeed 200 cm/s) runs 8 m above a lake on a cliff and pours over
# its lip at x = 0: the spline's steep reach (rise/run > Water::kRiverFallMinSlope) is drawn as the river's falling
# sheet (WaterRenderer fall rows, Vertex_WaterMesh.glslh WaterFallVertex) and answered by Water::RiverFallAt.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/Water_Falls.desce
# A barrel (Capsule R 25, Mass 70, Buoyancy Collider) 10 m above the lip is carried to it by the current, dragged
# down the sheet by the falling water's velocity (WaterQueryResult::Velocity = the baked flight's RiverFallSample::Speed)
# and floats in the lake, pushed off the foot by the plunge's outflow (PlungeVelocityAt).
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 100,600,-2200
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.1,-0.15,1
Когда run Action "Simulate"
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Тогда-вид 4_carried через 4 с бочку унесло к кромке
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Тогда-вид 5_dropped бочка упала и плавает в озере
